{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_title", "source_sha256": "3452c53815cb45c34a849d34b9017a34d8005cd5844b466ea5cfc930662f93e5", "ja": "スイート・マシュマロ・パーティー！", "zh": "甜蜜棉花糖派对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1c67458ec6836d14c00500d0ff4e846bf3e717b30601154d0da9db8545183d8d", "ja": "とびきり・わんだほー！な公演を目指し、\nぱわほー！なレッスンを開始するまつり達。\nハードなレッスンに疲れたメンバーは、\n途中、春香からの差し入れのマシュマロを\n使った甘いお菓子で、疲れを癒やす。", "zh": "以特别美妙的公演为目标！\n茉莉等人开始进行强大的训练课程！\n在艰苦的训练下，成员各个都很疲倦，\n途中她们吃了春香带来的慰劳品，\n让加入棉花糖的甜点疗愈了身心的疲惫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1000_021mat", "source_sha256": "66cb1be0539cd86daab819f33d36269865ef5bdcd92680e36c72a5fe5b4927f2", "ja": "と、いうわけで、\n歩ちゃんにも協力をお願いしたのです。", "zh": "就是这么回事，\n所以公主也请小步来帮忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "37709286015c3315c023755a17ab7d172df7ad6edcaffa1d4cf53357f74232a8", "ja": "と、いうわけなんだ。みんな、よろしくな！\nイエーイ！！", "zh": "就是这样，所以请大家多指教！\n耶～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1002_p", "source_sha256": "11c09856d55846e554499cd2058ec6ed6a48bcf3bc48287027c99dda9a74b98a", "ja": "「と、いうわけなんだ」と言われても……。歩、\nもう少しみんなにわかるように説明してくれないか。", "zh": "一句「就是这样」也太简短……\n步，你能不能说明得再清楚一些，让大家知道？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5428a2bfef52141a92bb427ca1630d7f517c7dc418577a087e9ad259e586e1b4", "ja": "まつりには、アタシのセンター公演の時に\nお世話になったからさ。その恩返しってコト！", "zh": "因为之前我在自己的Center公演时，\n受到茉莉很多帮助，这次是来报恩的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "163db7472626e4061876f1c8688d62f5ad295074d2f3ac3f476dfcf31b726fbc", "ja": "それから、今回は特別に先生をお呼びしたのです！\nまつりたちのレッスンを見てくれる先生……。", "zh": "另外，这次茉莉还特别请了老师过来喔！\n这位是帮茉莉我们指导训练课程的老师……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "f270a61eecfe5f622759d631133421043319a4e1b02a1dfd48247e1694b67fa4", "ja": "春香ちゃん！\n改め、春香先生！なのですー。", "zh": "小春香！\n应该要说，春香老师的唷──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "d755e0ff051ff3bac82761dcbb0a0b8c05011a37fc5aa0bea94f34209ba41bcf", "ja": "えへへ♪　先生なんて照れるなあ……。\nみんな、よろしくね！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪被称呼为老师好难为情啊……\n大家请多指教啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1007_p", "source_sha256": "256c433c6d201ca07c036595c843a59171c5e92de1a52125c4f45536b29d5ec4", "ja": "おお、春香も協力してくれるのか。", "zh": "哦哦，春香也会来帮忙啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "19cbc28f260b7c888af00259a10e763f05cdadc4ee7c00608190aded75fd57e7", "ja": "はい、{$P$}さん！\nまつりちゃんに、声をかけてもらったんです♪", "zh": "对啊，{$P$}先生！\n是茉莉邀请我的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "40a866e2c88b1499b16022db2b3c12d978c63a82493b3f6276950e33b8a0cee1", "ja": "春香先生、よろしくなのです。\n先生として、びしばし！しごいてほしいのです。", "zh": "春香老师，请多指教的喔。\n希望你能作为老师，严厉地鞭策茉莉我们唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "524ece57253d960d2ddc372ef2f7a7f41b4730f17e4f0908e40f52b591324b6b", "ja": "び、びしばし！？\nえっと、わ、私なりに精いっぱい、がんばるね！", "zh": "严、严厉地鞭策！？\n呃，我、我会以自己的方式尽量努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "d935d327dac737e83107be5388e202c921632aa066535ff2ff611023f0cb3f4f", "ja": "マツリ、ロコはアートディレクションですよね？\n今後のマイルストーンを確認しておきたいです！", "zh": "茉莉，ROCO是Art Direction对吧？\nROCO想先确认今后的Milestone！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "7f447c834c42ae207a9aa054beb4dac664568437d144a985a56a3f6d517c105a", "ja": "ロコちゃんはステージの演出案を、\n次のレッスンまでに100個出すのです。", "zh": "小ROCO要在下次的训练课程前，\n提出一百个舞台效果的方案唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "6a370eaf95c353f83ec0264be4888d8ff2253273577b0dc453a864e021041a5c", "ja": "オフコースで……ええっ！？\nひゃ、100！？", "zh": "Of course……什么！？\n一、一百个！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "af19cc26b575795f8bf5ea2a059fa2a58d755d2e774c0cf589a60f0756fd3b34", "ja": "まずは、数で勝負なのです！\nそこから練り上げていくのです！", "zh": "首先要以量取胜的呀！\n接着才是反复修正企划唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "a9eb4fdc4700b7af3193c10d2a5412bd7c665584342fcbc8bfce758ebd84cbf6", "ja": "ううっ、ま、負けません……！\n頑張ります～！！", "zh": "呜呜，RO、ROCO不会认输……！\nROCO会加油～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "16d9f93506046300c5858cc37dcfcbfe4e37200d9d1f2ba6d73869fb71b9cd6b", "ja": "ロコちゃん、期待しているのですよ♪\nではさっそく、レッスンを始めるのです！", "zh": "小ROCO，茉莉很期待你的表现喔♪\n那么就快点开始训练课程吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
