{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1039_025roc", "source_sha256": "f3dfaee9a964bc71c0edb2468b515962845f0c004ed884a4f8ef3d1828d511f9", "ja": "くるく……くるくるくるー！！\nと、遠くを！　遠くを見ますっ！！", "zh": "转转……转转转──！！\n远、远方！看远方！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1040_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1041_021mat", "source_sha256": "eb5d5f1fe34f6e00a844ae330d3f29c3226be46f74b24ffcc40311f814f48fea", "ja": "うん、いい感じなのです。みんな、\n一定のクオリティは出せるようになったのです。", "zh": "嗯，感觉很好的喔。\n大家都已经能够表现出一定的水准了唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1042_p", "source_sha256": "24d4925c4f52114d3c023102bc98f963c1ba314d965ef3cac79ad85a34322c3c", "ja": "（何のクオリティだ……！？）", "zh": "（哪方面的水准……！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1043_021mat", "source_sha256": "cb4ad0829bbbf095ddc69e9ae3237f928de54c51d4ea8d3dc1d84249622b8325", "ja": "ええと、次は……。", "zh": "唔，接下来是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1044_p", "source_sha256": "ebc0a2d236da7bfbb908d90de563b5d34bee524102d34d9c7738f2ccb788d0ea", "ja": "ま、まつり。みんな、だいぶ疲れてきてるから……\nこの辺りで一回、休憩にしようか。", "zh": "茉、茉莉。大家都已经很累了……\n就先休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1045_021mat", "source_sha256": "908f54a41428576c8858ee6ec329954e51f9a1bdeeab14f3aae9962f5993cd86", "ja": "ほ？　そうですね。ではみんな、ひと休みなのです。\n汗を拭いて、水分を取るのですよー。", "zh": "哦？说得也是，那么大家休息一下的喔。\n记得把汗擦一擦，好好补充水分唷──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1046_001har", "source_sha256": "e3b7b2a2aa8f6a102d5eea7630c19a4ab6784dc9d76b0cf34470e1b66136224b", "ja": "あっ！　私、差し入れに、まつりちゃんの好きな\nマシュマロで、お菓子を作ってきました！", "zh": "啊！我用茉莉喜欢的棉花糖做了点心，\n当作慰劳品带过来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1047_001har", "source_sha256": "d28d0ab256193efcebcf9148c6140f1c94df519161a699402e7e03f5db8e4cd4", "ja": "疲れた時には、やっぱり甘いものだよね！\nたくさんあるから、みんなでどうぞ♪", "zh": "疲劳的时候还是要吃甜食对吧！\n我做了很多，大家请用♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1048_p", "source_sha256": "9379ac9edcc49fdd972d913610f3fedbed0b6436a6a258e39b82053df3165a44", "ja": "おお！　マシュマロとチョコのクッキー、それに\nマシュマロの浮かんだココアか……さすが春香だな！", "zh": "哦哦！棉花糖巧克力饼干，\n还有棉花糖可可啊……真不愧是春香呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1049_021mat", "source_sha256": "7af45864fbe1d44a242078dbffa3f8d1f8f0c66b184034b95fd98db5177f4f14", "ja": "びゅーりほー！　さすが、春香ちゃんなのです！\nみんなで、ありがたくいただくのです♪", "zh": "太美丽了！真不愧是小春香的呀！\n大家要一起心存感激地享用唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1050_031tom", "source_sha256": "5c0b36a7a368d5890b20e0f1f5f32db01a234dce5e7fd5033798ac95962bfac4", "ja": "まぁ、とってもおいしそうですね～♪\nではさっそく、いただきますよ～。", "zh": "哇，看起来真美味～♪\n那么我就马上来享用了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1051_025roc", "source_sha256": "959909e6e9616a86bf0518966a923f4991ab839cf24e8ac7f89ec4ca4006c686", "ja": "ロコもいただきます！　ハムハム……。\nんん、とってもスイートです～♪", "zh": "ROCO也不客气了！（嚼嚼）……\n嗯嗯，非常Sweet～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1052_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8606a29b064658877ced509ffc18465bdd5c485dda3f612e207dc8afdf6e305b", "ja": "んん……ヤミー！　最高だね、この味！\nアメリカにいたころを思い出すよ～！", "zh": "嗯嗯……Yummy！这个味道真是太棒了！\n让我想起以前在美国的日子～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1053_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3cb88ea09a2925b1efda07443c3f60792392f9431f04088641d458e41baa0fd9", "ja": "レッスン休憩で、こんなにおいしいお菓子が\n食べられるなんて……毎日レッスンでもいいな♪", "zh": "没想到在训练的休息时间里，\n还可以吃到这么美味的点心……每天都上课也不错呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1054_001har", "source_sha256": "a9f6ff37545a0f30a9ae3a5c23ac41ae3e9acc23170e9eecb73094580ff2e70a", "ja": "ふふっ、よかった！\nそう言ってもらえて、うれしいな♪", "zh": "呵呵，太好了！\n真高兴能听到你这么说♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1055_031tom", "source_sha256": "1e5c4f63b6bb8b920a8b7464caf4d26ef00a8e2585b353e52e0b07ecd68cb6bf", "ja": "甘い物で疲れが取れると、改めて、力を合わせて\n公演を盛り上げようという気持ちになりますね～。", "zh": "吃完甜食消除疲劳后，\n又有种想跟大家合力办好公演的心情了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1056_025roc", "source_sha256": "0220140c41be2663b90522193c4a7731629ba3cc281934f0523729500fe96e0a", "ja": "トモカの言う通りです♪　ロコも、\nもう1ついただきますね！　パクっ。ハムハム……。", "zh": "朋花说得对♪ROCO也要再吃一个喔！\n咬！（嚼嚼）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1057_021mat", "source_sha256": "f964e3018b5a73051135d765687fd2dc4baf983c2e3ff252d69afb9e13536df9", "ja": "春香ちゃんのお菓子は絶品なのです。\nみんなで、どんどん食べるのですー！", "zh": "小春香的点心堪称一绝的唷。\n大家尽管享用喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1058_p", "source_sha256": "1842c34aac0308e68a9588916cc38b6386ef51eed02bb6dfa2385355d7ecc020", "ja": "（レッスンが終わり、みんなは一足先に帰った。\nまつりは残って、後片付けを手伝ってくれている）", "zh": "（训练课程结束后，其他人都先回去了，\n茉莉则留下来帮我收拾。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1059_p", "source_sha256": "c4760fb870668a473c7357f7c932036788d229c1de1328afab86c24567cab549", "ja": "まつり、お菓子あんまり食べてなかったみたいだけど、\nいいのか？　みんなに食べさせてばかりで……。", "zh": "茉莉，你好像没吃到多少点心，没关系吗？\n都让大家吃了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1060_021mat", "source_sha256": "60ab83a8eaa6fbecaa6d4d43ce1c09c390c5ec89b823416cc622e36ab11ca467", "ja": "ほ？　姫は、ちゃんといただいたのですよ。", "zh": "哦？公主可是有好好享用的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1061_p", "source_sha256": "a45cb8b9d92f8850732e553b9b384bc355cbc86439f5057caf02fa57196e3d7c", "ja": "でも……。", "zh": "可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1062_021mat", "source_sha256": "c087f3b6582ae69751f2b844d9e085ba5e71dab2f14d4f65d5af4f99d883b88d", "ja": "恥ずかしがり屋のお姫さまは、食べているところを\n人に見せないものなのですよ。それより……。", "zh": "害羞的公主不会让别人看到自己用餐时的模样喔。\n先不说这个了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1063_021mat", "source_sha256": "14ec71b5891b367c9c72ce70b39b5239771af88e66c2d80b2d44b7024fd04266", "ja": "はい、{$P$}さん！\nお口を開けるのです！　……あ～ん……？", "zh": "来，{$P$}先生！\n请张开嘴唷！啊～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1064_p", "source_sha256": "7b57c599f8a4c7db22823757b54294d5260bdf678686c5590499bcf3f4052682", "ja": "あ、あーん？　……モグモグ……ふう。\nやっぱり、春香のクッキーはおいしいな。", "zh": "呃、啊～？（嚼嚼）……呼。\n春香做的饼干果然很好吃呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1065_021mat", "source_sha256": "85216e4e812a9051b1acdeada377dc798f71e5328782c8720db31f6a19a0720c", "ja": "姫は、{$P$}さんやみんなの\nおいしそうな顔を見ると、はっぴー！なのです。", "zh": "公主只要看见{$P$}先生跟\n大家吃得开心的模样，就很开心了唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1066_021mat", "source_sha256": "a1e74c8993bffd1ae9df70bc0102653d31dbdafaeae8e4cf13c75a0e6e0efaf8", "ja": "だから姫に遠慮しないで、\nたくさん食べてほしいのです。ね？", "zh": "所以请不用介意公主，\n希望你能多吃一点喔。呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1067_p", "source_sha256": "ed750153baa21fc8aabfd70ea2c7b87f54da33acdf0255465a0f5ffbc48aca0c", "ja": "そうなのか。まあ、そういうこともあるか……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。嗯，也是有这种想法吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1068_021mat", "source_sha256": "16b46d774c8e33bc9ce41a6117f66b095e13873af503a79e82d2b37fb75cdff6", "ja": "そうなのです。\n……{$P$}さん？", "zh": "就是这样的喔。\n……{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1069_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1070_021mat", "source_sha256": "4243abccb677136e6e5c426e5563456d3abbbebb41afc55fa7b2fc9395bbfb79", "ja": "姫は、みんなに楽しんでもらいたいのです。\n……それは公演も、同じなのです。", "zh": "公主希望大家能够开心。\n……公演也是一样的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1071_021mat", "source_sha256": "c28cea668f2f9803528b2ea634ebc6b2a9059b8abee4b690e0d8eeae6b723eb3", "ja": "マシュマロみたいに、ふわふわであまあまな\nステージを、ファンのみんなに届けたいのです。", "zh": "公主想带给粉丝们有如棉花糖般，\n软绵绵、甜蜜蜜的表演喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1072_021mat", "source_sha256": "eb921083dcd65dab45876e4484dd4e9501b34b6d0e660198cb75058b59fe4b70", "ja": "姫の気持ちは……届くでしょうか……。", "zh": "公主的心意……能不能传达出去呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1073_p", "source_sha256": "6094b2ba3b5d78879b368d96b5801adda53f5ec2531cd09cdde8a27207dc1746", "ja": "大丈夫、きっと届くよ。今日のレッスンも、\nまつりのおかげで最後まで楽しかったし。", "zh": "没问题，大家一定能感受到的。\n今天的课程也是多亏有茉莉，才能一直开心到最后啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1074_p", "source_sha256": "eff954ae2559115f0683fb739820f220525c5a209206950fdc4b58b907acb0f4", "ja": "今、俺もすっかり、ふわふわであまあまな\n気持ちなんだ。……だから大丈夫！", "zh": "我现在的心情已经完全变得软绵绵、甜蜜蜜了。\n……所以没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1076_021mat", "source_sha256": "a8305bdb49164d8cd3b4065b948cc4f02650473f4756a694bd73c7261370c18c", "ja": "それなら、よかったのです。……ふふっ！", "zh": "既然如此，那就好的唷……呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_027_1077_p", "source_sha256": "a784cfefc88ae9dd91a06aec7ae2a0ac5a14e50ecd3b911d84b3771b39d7000b", "ja": "（その後も、ハードなレッスンと甘いお菓子を経て、\nまつりの公演準備期間は終わった……）", "zh": "（在这之后，经历同样艰苦的训练课程及\n香甜点心的陪伴，茉莉的公演准备期间结束了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
